    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can stow up to two held objects, each with a different hand, as a swift action. You can attempt one Sleight of Hand check either to lift an object or hide an object on your person as part of a move, standard, or full-round action to move, or as part of a standard or longer action to attempt a Bluff, Diplomacy, or Intimidate check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/subterfuge#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
